Dialogue: 99,0:00:04.94,0:00:08.99,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Într-o zi, am reușit să obțin abilitatea de a \Nvedea nivelul afecțiunii fetelor față de mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:10.16,0:00:13.24,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acel termometru pare deprins \Ndintr-un film horror...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.24,0:00:15.25,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce naiba ar trebui \Nsă mă fac cu el?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.75,0:00:20.12,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și nivelul afecțiunii lui Toyotomi \Nfață de mine e foarte scăzut.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.46,0:00:24.34,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dacă va rămâne așa...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:24.50,0:00:27.92,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Hahaha! Nu trebuia \Nsă-mi ieși în cale.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.76,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Ești o risipă de oxigen! \NMai bine mori!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.80,0:00:29.76,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nu are niciun sens!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.89,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dacă ne-am putea înțelege \Nca doi oameni normali...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.89,0:00:34.51,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Hei, Kitami.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.97,0:00:38.69,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,De ce naiba te holbezi la mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.69,0:00:40.73,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Am cumva ceva pe față?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.73,0:00:43.98,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,A-Ah, T-T-Toyotomi,\Ne-e-eu doar...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.65,0:00:47.03,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Ești așa un papă-lapte...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:47.69,0:00:49.82,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.20,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Da, acum pot vedea \Ntermometre ale afecțiunii,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:53.20,0:00:55.74,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}dar asta e cam tot ce pot face.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.20,0:00:58.75,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Acest parc...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.50,0:01:01.79,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, da, îmi amintesc că eu și Marika
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.79,0:01:05.38,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}obișnuiam să ne jucăm \Nîn nisip când eram mici.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.55,0:01:12.09,Dialogue,MASHIRO,0,0,0,,Au, m-am lovit la picior!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.68,0:01:18.56,Dialogue,MASHIRO,0,0,0,,M-am întors, surioară!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:18.56,0:01:21.44,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Hei, Mashiro, bine ai reve...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.44,0:01:24.19,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,T-T-Tu ce cauți aici, Kitami?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.36,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Bună, Toyotomi.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.36,0:01:29.28,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Mashiro s-a lovit la genunchi, \Nașa că i-am pus un plasture pe rană...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.99,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,iar apoi mi-a cerut s-o \Nconduc până acasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:32.91,0:01:35.70,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Oh. Păi... ei bine... mersi.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:36.12,0:01:38.04,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Pentru nimic!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:38.04,0:01:39.95,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ei bine, voi pleca acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.96,0:01:44.21,Dialogue,MASHIRO,0,0,0,,Domnule, nu vrei să rămâi la cină?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.21,0:01:45.21,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.21,0:01:48.30,Dialogue,MASHIRO,0,0,0,,Mâncarea făcută de \Nsora mea e super bună!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.30,0:01:49.30,Dialogue,MASHIRO,0,0,0,,Nu-i așa?!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.72,0:01:55.89,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Kitami… hai să mănânci \Ncu noi dacă tot ești aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.89,0:01:57.31,Dialogue,MASHIRO,0,0,0,,Ura!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.31,0:02:00.27,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Dar nu garantez că va fi pe placul tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.31,0:02:04.56,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nivelul afecțiunii a crescut un pic!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.56,0:02:06.31,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Bine, dacă insiști!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.61,0:02:12.24,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Întâlnirea comitetului de curățenie s-a \Nîntins mai mult decât mi-aș fi dorit...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.86,0:02:15.07,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc pentru cină, Toyotomi!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.03,0:02:21.08,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanata a fost acasă la Toyotomi?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.54,Dialogue,MASHIRO,0,0,0,,Să mai treci pe la noi, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.54,0:02:25.79,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.84,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}U-U-Un copil?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.84,0:02:29.80,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}K-K-Kanata are cumva \No familie secretă?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.25,0:02:34.05,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Poți oricând să mai vii pe la noi, \Ndacă dorești, Kanata.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:35.05,0:02:37.14,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-I-a spus pe prenume?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.14,0:02:38.81,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chiar atât de apropiați sunt?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.81,0:02:41.60,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(510,0)}Oare cei doi sunt un...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:42.02,0:02:45.10,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Pfiu! A fost delicios.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.77,0:02:48.65,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Sayuki, ce spui de niște desert?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.65,0:02:50.98,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Văd că nu te poți abține.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.98,0:02:52.65,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Dacă îți dorești atât de...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.53,0:02:56.41,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Nu mă refeream la \Ngenul acela de desert.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.75,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,K-Kanata...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.50,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Sayuki…
Dialogue: 99,0:03:12.30,0:03:14.55,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Kanata…
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.18,0:03:20.26,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Vrei...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.26,0:03:22.64,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Vrei cumva să mă \Nmănânci și pe mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.72,0:03:25.48,Dialogue,TOYOTOMI,0,0,0,,Ești așa de nesătul...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.39,0:03:30.06,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Iar tu ești așa de dulce, \Nîncât nu mă pot abține.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.53,0:03:40.91,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Distrugătoarea aceea de relații!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.95,0:03:42.03,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Distrugătoarea aceea de relații!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.37,0:03:44.50,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Ce naiba...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.20,0:03:47.00,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Marika?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.00,0:03:50.21,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce naiba se întâmplă \Ncu termometrul ei?!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:50.21,0:03:52.42,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,Kanata, ești un prost!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.21,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Stai!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.72,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}E cumva vina mea?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.72,0:04:00.97,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Întâlnirea comitetului de curățenie mi-a \Nfurat din prețiosul meu timp cu Kanata.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.97,0:04:04.06,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}În ultima vreme, \Nabia am reușit să vorbesc cu el
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.06,0:04:08.39,Dialogue,MARIKA,0,0,0,,{\i1}și mi-e teamă că m-am cam \Nîngrășat din cauza dulciurilor!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.94,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Marika! Așteaptă, te rog!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.69,0:04:19.45,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,Stai! Vino înapoi! Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:22.74,0:04:25.54,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Viața mea amoroasă imprevizibilă...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.54,0:04:26.95,Dialogue,KANATA,0,0,0,,{\i1}abia a început...
